    "Description": "CA-07c component-collection CONSUMER demo. Instance blueprint. Tick graph: GetComponent\u003CBpCollectionDemo\u003E(self) exposes its \u0022Values\u0022 virtual collection (CA-07a, curated BpCollectionDemoOps accessors), fanned out into all three CA-07b consumer nodes -- ComponentForEach (mirrors CurrentItem into LoopLastItem each iteration), ComponentItemGet (Index=0 literal -\u003E ElementOut), ComponentItemCount (-\u003E CountOut). Every consumer\u0027s ComponentTypeFqn/accessor FQNs are authored here exactly as the CA-07c wire-bake hook (BlueprintCommandSink.TryBakeCollectionConsumer) would bake them live when the designer drags the wire in the editor. Pair with GetComponentDemo/GetComponentTargetDemo/SetComponentDemo (scalar-field demos).",
